# The natural numbers and reduction rules

Lean and its type theory — chapter 1

:::notes
Second lecture, chapter 1.1. By the end they should know why `rfl`
closes some goals and gets stuck on others.

Three sheets hang on this hour: `1.1-a` in week 2 (recursor only),
`1.1-b` in week 3 (`Bool`, `cases`), `1.1-c` in week 4 (Mathlib
